 {'idx': 20, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'Controversy of The MDNA Tour American singer Madonna was embroiled with a number of controversy during The MDNA Tour. It was her ninth concert tour, promoting her twelfth studio album, "MDNA" (2012). The tour has generated many newspaper headlines and news coverage for its use of fake firearms during performances, Madonna\'s nudity on stage, and her promotion of LGBT rights, freedom of speech and political issues. Madonna was threatened with a lawsuit in France for using an image of French far-right politician Marine Le Pen with a swastika on her forehead during a video interlude and also in Russia for', 'title': 'Controversy of The MDNA Tour'}
