 {'idx': 24, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': 'I Don\'t Give A "I Don\'t Give A" is a song recorded by American singer-songwriter Madonna for her twelfth studio album "MDNA" (2012). The song features rap vocals by American recording artist Nicki Minaj. It was written and produced by Madonna and Martin Solveig, with additional songwriting by Minaj and Julien Jabre. "I Don\'t Give A" is a pop song, with electronic and hip hop syncopated beats. Lyrically, the song is about a day in Madonna\'s life with some portions of it directed at her ex-husband, film director Guy Ritchie, when she sings about a failed marriage. The song received', 'title': "I Don't Give A"}
