 {'idx': 24, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'I Feel Like Buddy Holly "I Feel Like Buddy Holly" is a song recorded by Alvin Stardust in 1984, written and produced by Mike Batt. The song spent 11 weeks on the UK Singles Chart, reaching number 7 in 1984. The single was released on Chrysalis Records, and included the song "Luxury" on the B-side, which was written and produced by Alvin Stardust. The song appears on numerous compilation albums, including "The Very Best of Alvin Stardust" (1996), "Alvin Stardust: New Recordings of His Greatest Hits" (2001), "Best of Alvin Stardust" (2006), "The Alvin Stardust Story" (2007), and "My Coo', 'title': 'I Feel Like Buddy Holly'}
