 {'idx': 25, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'American) English (Singapore) The Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok The series originally ran in the magazine "Monthly Shōnen Gangan" under the name "The Mythical Detective Loki" (魔探偵ロキ, "Matantei Loki"), but "Ragnarok" was added to the title when the series was purchased by publishing company MAG Garden and moved to "Comic Blade" magazine. "The Mythical Detective Loki" was collected in 7 volumes by "Gangan Comics", which were later republished by "Blade Comics"; it has not been officially licensed for US distribution. "The Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok" ran for 5 more volumes, which were published in Japan by "Blade Comics", and picked up', 'title': 'The Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok'}
